{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Throttle Fantasy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not fast enough? Then come a little closer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexy biker girls tearing through the scorching streets of Miami, kicking up the heat with every rev of the engine \u2014 this is your wild ride back to the chaotic thrill of childhood brawls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>reimagined homage to the classic <i>Road Rash</i></strong>, now spiced with that extra &quot;naughty&quot; kick you didn\u2019t know you needed. This is <i>riding</i> like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Signature Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Naughty Weapons:</strong> Vibrators, Whips, Chains, Love Eggs, Shock Batons...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Sporty Weapons:</strong> Baseball Bats, Golf Clubs, Cue Sticks...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Melee Weapons:</strong> Axes, Steel Pipes, Machetes, Sledgehammers, Chainsaws...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Firearms:</strong> Pistols, Rifles, Harpoon Guns, Tether Blasters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Legendary Weapons:</strong> Heavenly Halberd, Crescent Moon Blade, Silver Dragon Lance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hit triggers a unique reaction \u2014 in <strong>full voice-over</strong>, available in <strong>English, Japanese, Korean, and Chinese</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You won\u2019t want to stop. And maybe... you can\u2019t.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World of Desire &amp; Speed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>expansive city</strong> where lust collides with velocity. Over <strong>100 km\u00b2 of adrenaline-fueled freedom</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bustling downtowns with scorching energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sensual, sun-drenched beaches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suburban secrets waiting to be uncovered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazard-packed industrial zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild, seductive mountain forests...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride motorcycles, race horses, pilot planes, cruise yachts, and <strong>enjoy the constant company of your moto girls</strong> \u2014 every second of this city teases your senses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hot-Blooded Biker Babes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebel delinquent girls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yandere-style idols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotionless tech engineers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovable loli airheads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark queen dominatrixes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber rave DJs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lazy pajama cuties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poisonous femme fatales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eastern sword-maidens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tsundere rich girls\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one with <strong>personality, voice, and a punch</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Iron Beasts of Battle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flame Outlaw</strong> \u2013 Raw power and fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Pulse</strong> \u2013 Electric rhythm and light trails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Queen\u2019s Ride</strong> \u2013 Luxury meets punishment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bone Serpent</strong> \u2013 Dark speed with venom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skysting Ninja</strong> \u2013 Agile and lethal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Azure Beast</strong> \u2013 Eastern spirit machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cuddle Cruiser</strong> \u2013 Adorable but deadly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mecha Hornet</strong> \u2013 Futuristic sting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubble Blaster</strong> \u2013 Cute chaos on wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iron Judgement</strong> \u2013 Justice at full throttle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle is <strong>deadly, distinct, and absolutely dripping in style</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Rider Valkyries&quot; is still under development, but we\u2019re racing full throttle with you. Add us to your wishlist \u2014 let\u2019s cross that finish line together!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691920?t=1767900961","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691920/da6e564faf388ecdb056cea80709fc65cdadbbb0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767900961","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691920/6d0411dd2a155b0cfef107476304402a08c4e78e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767900961","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691920/6d0411dd2a155b0cfef107476304402a08c4e78e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767900961","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3740270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Throttle Fantasy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not fast enough? Then come a little closer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexy biker girls tearing through the scorching streets of Miami, kicking up the heat with every rev of the engine \u2014 this is your wild ride back to the chaotic thrill of childhood brawls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>reimagined homage to the classic <i>Road Rash</i></strong>, now spiced with that extra &quot;naughty&quot; kick you didn\u2019t know you needed. This is <i>riding</i> like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Signature Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_par